{
  "name": "beginner-5x5-row-set-to-45",
  "note": "The mockup's change example: the barbell row set to 45 kg from week 5, a new series with its week 1 at programme week 5. The mockup's after values: 45, 47.5, 50, 47.5 (deload). Week 6's hand-edit (35 kg) is the replay's (W2).",
  "document": {
